# Rust
/target/
**/*.rs.bk
Cargo.lock.bak

# WASM build outputs (wasm-bindgen-cli writes ./pkg next to the crate;
# also covers the new packages/wasm/pkg/ home per ADR-0031)
/crates/fossil-wasm/pkg/

# IDE
.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/settings.json
.DS_Store

# Claude Code local files
CLAUDE.local.md

# GSD planning artifacts (commit_docs=false per .planning/config.json)
.planning/

# Walking-skeleton local-run artefacts (per Phase 1 plan 01-07).
# `fossil compile examples/hello.fossil` writes these to cwd; ignore them at
# repo root so casual smoke tests don't dirty the tree.
/output.parquet
/manifest.yaml
/.scratch-walking-skel/

# === JS/TS ecosystem (pnpm monorepo per ADR-0031) ===
node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.next/
**/.vite/
**/.turbo/
# wasm-bindgen output is committed-elsewhere or built-on-demand, never tracked
packages/wasm/pkg/
# individual changesets are PR-bound; config + README are tracked
.changeset/*.md
!.changeset/config.json
!.changeset/README.md
# TS incremental build state
*.tsbuildinfo
